author=chenchaosuperman
description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, MAC blacklist/whitelist, scheduling, SMS forward, Mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk/Bark notifications, hidden SSID, device diagnostics. Generic Android compatibility via Hotspot Compatibility Layer (capability-driven; system SoftApConfiguration as single source of truth, writes via Framework setSoftApConfiguration Binder Bridge). Verified: Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16 / KernelSU. v1.7.6-beta: one-config with system hotspot settings, Binder Bridge, 7 unified APIs, 6GHz support.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenchaosuperman-cell/Android-Hotspot-Web/main/update.json
